zig-source-audit source provenance

The initial structure_metrics.zig, import_graph.zig and source_readability.zig
were extracted from tools/lib/ in the project-owned zg-front repository at
ef6142fffa8979f1c1c56e1f727147318b6854f9 on 2026-11-03. Original explanatory
comments, algorithms and regression cases are retained. Product-specific import
rules remain in that consumer. The owned report, configurable rule evaluator
and standalone CLI are new package surfaces.

The code uses the installed Zig compiler's standard AST/tokenizer libraries;
no compiler or third-party source tree is bundled in this package.
